# Gaze in a conversation: the nearest npc (Xardas in the default save) and the hero talk; the hero
# stands in front, goes around to the side, behind the back and back; then the talk ends
cheat god
view clean 60
watch nearest
freeze nearest       # Xardas leaves his bookstand: a free body turns the chest too
wait 500
cam front 230 40
cam look 150
place 150 0
wait 800
rec quiet
wait 1000
talk nearest 14000
rec front
wait 1500
rec side
orbit 120 3000
wait 3000
rec behind
orbit 50 1500
wait 1500
rec back
orbit -170 3000
wait 3000
rec busy             # back at the bookstand: the head only
freeze nearest off
place 150 60
wait 3000
stop
wait 4000
rec after
wait 1500
stop
